msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Depannage"

#: ../../docs/tools/retailguard/operations.md:13
#: 5c902f2071114530b52c7150d05f6cfb
msgid "Confirm the repository and branch."
msgstr "Confirmez le depot et la branche."

#: ../../docs/tools/retailguard/operations.md:14
#: e3a7cb00f063475f91c4440e699b7a55
msgid "Reproduce with the smallest supported input."
msgstr "Reproduisez avec la plus petite entree prise en charge."

#: ../../docs/tools/retailguard/operations.md:15
#: b1fd388360874df6a79ffef006110881
msgid "Capture the exact command and error."
msgstr "Consignez la commande et l'erreur exactes."

#: ../../docs/tools/retailguard/operations.md:16
#: 137bf6d4439c4e20884792f9639afdc3
msgid "Check the documented runtime and lockfile."
msgstr "Verifiez le runtime documente et le fichier de verrouillage."

#: ../../docs/tools/retailguard/operations.md:17
#: 01e781082c504084aa55a63812c939bc
msgid "Open an issue with secret-free evidence."
msgstr "Ouvrez une issue avec des preuves sans secret."

#: ../../docs/tools/retailguard/operations.md:19
#: a38472c1773b425ab910a9a09e8fd527
msgid "Security and privacy"
msgstr "Securite et vie privee"

#: ../../docs/tools/retailguard/operations.md:21
#: 7ca831c14eba40fd93412e697598555a
msgid ""
"RetailGuard is for prevention, simulation, and supervised defensive "
"education only."
msgstr ""
"RetailGuard sert uniquement a la prevention, a la simulation et a "
"l'education defensive supervisee."

#: ../../docs/tools/retailguard/operations.md:23
#: 4be1ead6c1d9444c92dc50d247a48a17
msgid "Contributing"
msgstr "Contribuer"

#: ../../docs/tools/retailguard/operations.md:25
#: d3a2cdf03ad74ede87fe52156c8cfa60
msgid ""
"Read `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `SECURITY.md`, `SAFETY.md`, and the repository "
"license when present. Keep changes bounded and include the checks that "
"justify acceptance."
msgstr ""
"Lisez `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `SECURITY.md`, `SAFETY.md` et la licence du depot "
"lorsqu'ils existent. Gardez les changements bornes et incluez les controles "
"qui justifient leur acceptation."

#: ../../docs/tools/retailguard/operations.md:27
