msgid "Releases"
msgstr "Versions publiees"

#: ../../docs/tools/retailguard/operations.md:29
#: 82268b3ddee24142b64b5d8acdc2e0a6
msgid ""
"The current public documentation describes `pre-alpha` with status `public-"
"preview`. Consult the repository history and release notes for changes."
msgstr ""
"La documentation publique actuelle decrit `pre-alpha` avec le statut "
"`public-preview`. Consultez l'historique du depot et les notes de version "
"pour les changements."
